    "subtopic_id": "science/grade_08/ch_13/H008",
    "stem": "Ananya's class visits a hillside trail. They collect crumbly rock pieces, dark garden soil that holds plant and leaf remains, and note rocky slopes, soft valleys, and gravel beds where different plants grow.\n\nAnswer both parts.",
